&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;退職給付債務の期首残高&lt;/p&gt;
